    "### Step 2: 🧠 向量转换和存储\n",
    "**目标**：把文本变成AI能理解的数学向量\n",
    "\n",
    "```python\n",
    "# 向量化示例\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "from sentence_transformers import SentenceTransformer\n",
    "\n",
    "# 加载预训练的embedding模型\n",
    "model = SentenceTransformer('paraphrase-multilingual-MiniLM-L12-v2')\n",
    "\n",
    "def embed_documents(chunks):\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    将文本片段转换为向量\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    vectors = model.encode(chunks)\n",
    "    return vectors\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Embedding核心价值：**\n",
    "• 将语义相似的内容映射到相近的数学空间\n",
    "• 支持「以义搜义」而非简单关键词匹配\n",
    "• 不同模态（文本、图像、音频）都可以向量化"
   ]
